WEBVTT

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.790
The cause of death was
high voltage electricity again.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.660
Another young woman...

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:40.040
Look, the culprit left that behind.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.950
"Your destiny is mine"...

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.830
He sure left something interesting behind.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:00.580
There has been a report of another
unnatural death two blocks down.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.580
Damn, another one?

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.120
Looks like another weird guy
is wandering around.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.160
The culprit left a message. To monsters.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.250
Are you saying it was addressed to us?

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.750
It doesn't have anything to do with us.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.410
There are monsters everywhere around here.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:18.450
Who cares about humans anymore?

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:20.410
Did you do this?!

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.120
Belo!

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.120
Where have you been?

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.290
It's been a long time! How are you?

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.000
What?

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.000
What's with him?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.580
He's been pretty distant lately.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.700
Maybe he lost against Daryl?

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.040
There's no way that Belo would lose.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.370
Hey, Mr. Shock.

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:01.080
Those cases are your doing, aren't they?

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.750
Why are you only targeting women?

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:07.540
I don't think you would
understand my reasoning.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.660
Ouch!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:09.750
What the hell?!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:12.410
You're always so angry.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:16.000
I loosened the stressful
knot in your heart.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.950
I'm curious about those words you left
on that wall. What does it mean?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:26.750
You all wanted to smoke out
that monster, right? I felt it was fate.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.200
I wand to do it, too!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.580
The murders won't stop until he appears.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.080
I don't like it.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.750
That attitude of yours!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.330
It always pisses me off!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.700
Leab it to me!

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.700
Oh, what a terrible smell.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:51.660
You were the one that caused it.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.700
It was as grotesque as I thought.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.790
You looked?

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.580
I didn't look closely!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.250
He's been like that all morning.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.790
Everyone is curious about it.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:27.750
I heard this from the boys, but he said
something weird is wandering the Outside.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:30.080
He's been unusually passionate about it.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.500
Speaking of weird, isn't Roddy weird, too?

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.830
No way! That's too funny!

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.250
Annie, let's go.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.250
Yeah.

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:02.160
Everyone was saying that you've been
looking at a creepy site all day.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.790
Are you curious about it?!

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:07.040
Something weird is roaming
the Outside, right?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.910
Yes, that's exactly right!

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.830
A case of serial murders where the victims
are murdered in a strange way!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:14.040
I mean, the women have all
died from electrocution!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.580
Some of the victims have a mysterious
powder scattered around them.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.120
Isn't that weird?! Weird!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.950
The Outside is definitely weird!

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.080
There's something there.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.410
Something that we don't know!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.330
What something is that?

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.450
That's what I'm looking into!

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.830
The internet says they are probably
modded humans or super humans,

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:33.040
but I'm still searching for the truth.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.200
Yeah, that's how it is.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.830
That's right. That's right.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:40.790
So, Annabella, you have to stay away from
the Outside! Girls are being targeted!

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:41.870
Roddy, you know...

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:42.790
Huh?

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:46.450
You talk fast when you explain things.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:53.580
Yes, there's definitely something there.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.080
Something...

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:59.910
The word monster and the serial murders
using electrocution...

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:04.330
Do you remember the monster
I encountered previously?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.330
Yeah, the thing you said you saw before.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:12.540
Yes, that monster used electricity
to destroy the water monster.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:14.450
I wrote it in my report.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:17.660
I requested the report to be
submitted to headquarters as well.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.870
Oh, that.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.160
It hasn't gotten past our division.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.540
You mean you stopped it.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.870
Who would believe that monsters are
disguising themselves as humans?!

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:30.410
The 18th precinct would
become a laughingstock!

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:35.370
These serial murders match
the powers of that monster!

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:39.500
If we don't think of countermeasures
quickly, there will be more victims!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.950
Calm down.

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:44.000
If you act that irritated,
you'll be transferred off again.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:50.120
Could the words left on that wall
indicate a scuffle between monsters?

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:54.910
The people of Outside are being
dragged into their fight!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.910
The words on that wall
haven't been made public.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.120
It will be our trump card
in the capture of our culprit.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.870
The citizens have been forbidden
to go out late at night.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.450
We've taken measures.

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:08.290
In regard to that monster,
you'll just have to catch it yourself.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.700
I understand. I will prove his existence.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.620
Then, on to the next case.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:17.700
There are three other cases of unnatural
deaths discovered on the same days

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:19.790
and times of the electrocution murders.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:23.120
At each scene, there is some kind of
powder scattered around the victim.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:28.830
The powder was analyzed and found
to be made of human skin and starch.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.410
There is another monster...

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.040
Another fake ID?

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.540
What was her name again?

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.870
Is that girl doing well?

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.660
There is something I'd like to ask.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:05.500
You really cut right to the punch.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.410
The victims were all electrocuted.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.830
Do you have any idea?

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.330
Electricity, huh?

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.250
Was there a guy like that?

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:15.160
Is there someone who can give
others that kind of power?

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.120
Hm?

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:20.330
I heard there was a professor who
could give humans special powers.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.910
If rumors are enough, I got something.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:26.120
He started living here about ten years ago.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:30.330
Supposedly, he's a crazy professor
with about a hundred loose screws.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:34.700
As long as you got the money, he'll do
any kind of body modifications you ask.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:47.450
Hey, miss.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.580
Yes?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:52.450
It's your destiny to be loved by me.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.500
What?!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.830
After all, you make my heart tingle so...

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:00.200
Now it's my turn.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:04.950
I will make those eyes tingle sweetly.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:24.950
Were you watching?

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:27.000
Do you know of it?

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:30.330
The tale of a monster that can transform
from a human to a monster?

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.370
I don't.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.120
Then, die!

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.330
Hey, get behind me!

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.330
Huh?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.950
There've been a lot of electrocutions
and bodies with scattered powder.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:03.200
There are other types of victims, too.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:06.950
It seems a bunch of perverts have
started a real murder fest.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.250
Where is Sonia?

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.080
She's running around.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.200
She said she would find that monster.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:16.160
No wonder she was kicked out of Upper.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.660
She's starting to get used to the place...

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.120
But that Jeanne d'Arc is a real wild one.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.580
What the hell is that?

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:25.040
They call her that at the crime scenes.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:55.200
Hello. Do you need some maintenance?

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.500
I just came by to recharge.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.910
That really clears up the mind!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.080
Perfect timing.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.870
I created a medicine that will
make your hair springy.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.910
Will you help me with the clinical trials?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:10.950
That's not to my taste.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.750
Test it on that guy.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.830
I have to use a completely different
technique to grant his request.

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:18.700
So, he's not a fitting test subject.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:19.830
I see.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:22.950
Was it you, after all?

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:25.870
The one who made the one that killed him?

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.410
Made? Me?

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.790
Am I wrong?

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:35.750
Turning a human into a heteromorphic monster
is a technique I can only dream of finding.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:39.540
Though I think the ability to turn a human into
water or to give them resistance to electricity

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.410
are worthy achievements in themselves?

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:42.290
Not at all.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:46.000
Anyone can do something of that level,
as long as they have a bit of knowledge.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:49.540
The ability to change form completely
and then change back

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.660
would be a great invention that I
would like to be able to do myself.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.450
Then, what do you think it was?

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:59.250
Probably a monstrosity?

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.330
Monstrosity?

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:03.250
It's a term I heard somewhere once before.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:05.950
Is it okay to kill that monstrosity?

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:06.950
Feel free.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.870
Isn't it killing the things I've created?

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.750
Please take care of it.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.790
Hey, Jeanne.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.450
Jeanne? My name is Sonia.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.660
You really can't take a joke.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.750
Hey, we got some witnesses.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.500
They only caught a quick glimpse,

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.950
but it was a tall man similar
to the one you've seen before.

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.750
What terrible taste.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.700
Attacking women that are walking alone.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.120
You're a woman, too, so be caref--

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:51.080
Are you serious?

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.830
I am sure that the word monster
is directed toward us.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.540
You're over thinking it.

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:58.870
There's no way to know it's us.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.540
He is calling for us.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:05.620
We are to blame for the death of those victims.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.540
He's only targeting young girls.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.580
So, it would be best for me to be bait.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:13.450
There is no meaning if you
don't catch his attention.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:16.250
Your words are strangely hurtful.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:19.120
It doesn't matter how many
times you save them.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.580
You'll just experience more terrible things.

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.410
Even so, it's better than humans dying.

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:51.500
Beautiful lady, won't you play with me?

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.000
It's your eyes...

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.790
They shot a bolt of lightning through my heart.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.040
Your destiny is mine...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.750
Destiny?!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:07.000
Destiny... Are you the culprit...?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.540
Oh? This make me happy!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:13.040
So, you know who I am?

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.450
So pretty!

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:28.830
Lady! My destiny with you
will have to be another time!

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:31.950
I have a prior electrifying engagement!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:51.160
You chose a nice place.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:54.500
Oh, you are the man from before.

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:57.410
I'm sure this party will be a blast.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.910
Here!

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:18.830
No wonder Doctor was so jealous!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.450
Even his bone structure changed!

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.620
Here!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.500
Starch!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:46.580
Dis one is mine!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.040
Dat tickles!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.040
Wut are you doing?

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:55.080
Starch, it's not good to snatch from others.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:59.290
No hurt feelings, whoever wins!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:08.080
I heard you're a monstrosity?

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:10.330
Monstrosity...

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.660
If you're going to die,

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.580
I'd like it if you died by my hands!

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.040
You're in the way, Starch!

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:23.660
You're da one in da way!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.750
Ow! You've dun it now!

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.410
Got you!

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:36.660
Dat hurts, Shock!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:37.660
Here!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.120
Run.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:50.330
You're mine!

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:53.160
Just die already, Starch!

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:04.910
Let's finish things with this!

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.040
Here!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.290
Oh, you absorbed it all.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:24.620
I'm da one who is gonna do it, Shock!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:28.870
You came.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.410
I couldn't leave you alone.

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:35.040
Annuder one!

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:35.040
Late for our date?

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.410
Bad girl!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:56.200
This is the best! Monstrosities!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:19:00.500
Let my shine turn you both to dust!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.120
I got caught innut!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:14.330
Now you can't eat or shoot electricity.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:16.870
Th-This is unfair!

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.290
How many of you are there?!

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:21.160
Stupid, you got too cocky.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:23.500
You chose such a troublesome place.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:25.830
But that's your goal, isn't it?

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.330
Let's go. Harden it.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:39.410
It's hard?! It got rock hard!

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:44.330
This is your electricity. Take it back.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:24.450
Monstrosities... But...

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.910
He protected me?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.700
How tiring.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.080
Why did you come?

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:50.000
I guess we're monsters, after all?

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:58.160
Even so, there are things we must do.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.870
The last one has been confirmed as Beta.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.450
What shall we do?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.410
Good work, everyone.

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:20.290
It seems others have begun
calling them monstrosities...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:23.160
Monstrosities, you say?

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:27.120
What an interesting word.

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:31.620
Those things are called humanoid monsters.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:38.200
I must cause you all some trouble.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:42.250
Please bring those three creatures to me.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:53.370
Father, please give me strength.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:55.950
I want the power to fight!

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:11.370
It hurds. It huuurds!

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:23.870
All cleaned up.
